{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10298","headline":"赠鉴上人 · 皇甫曾","name":"赠鉴上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律仪传教诱，僧腊老烟霄。\n树色依禅诵，泉声入寂寥。\n宝龛经末劫，画壁见南朝。\n深竹风开合，寒潭月动摇。\n息心归静理，爱道坐中宵。\n更欲寻真去，乘船过海潮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}